# Storefront deployment: rendered nginx config (contains the live domain) and
# the generated secrets file.
deploy/nginx/active.conf
deploy/storefront.env

# Fitted model artifacts. They are the seller's, they are large, and a
# stale one committed alongside code that moved on is a silent wrong answer.
models/

# Rebuilt one-minute candles. Derived data, not source: research/backfill_candles.py
# reconstructs every byte of it from Kraken's public trade tape, and nine assets of
# it is ~75 MB of JSONL that would be stale the day after it was committed.
data/candles/

# The training dataset and its settlement cache. Kept out of git because both
# grow without bound, but note the asymmetry with data/candles/ above: candles
# are reproducible from Kraken forever, whereas a dataset row records the Kalshi
# book at an instant that no longer exists once decisions.jsonl rotates at 24h.
# Losing this directory loses history that cannot be rebuilt. Back it up.
data/dataset/
data/settlements.jsonl
